<title>USA: Philippines approved for rice through PL480-USDA.</title>
<headline>Philippines approved for rice through PL480-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said Friday it amended its PL-480 agreement with the Philippines to allow for purchase of $10 million of U.S. rice.</p>
<p>USDA said the change meant up to $15 million in rice, or about 41,000 tonnes could be purchased when an earlier $5 million allocation was considered.</p>
</text>
